    "This exact item was signed in Lune {l} and sealed into that tide. It has not changed by a single byte since.": "Este elemento exacto se firmó en la Lune {l} y se selló en esa marea. No ha cambiado ni un solo byte desde entonces.",
    "FOUND, SEALS SOON": "ENCONTRADO, SE SELLA PRONTO",
